      "text": "Welcome to The Favorites, presented by DraftKings. The crown is yours. We are an Action Network podcast, and my co-host, Kendra Middleton, is having a hard time keeping it together. Back at it with the first lady of the pod, Miss Middleton, Evan Abrams keeping us in check as well. Our top 20 quarterbacks in the NFL continues as we go ten through one today."
