      "text": "Well, that explains why Herbert was missing. I have Trevor Lawrence at number ten. I know people have been tough on him, but he has been dealt a really bad hand throughout his career with coaching staff issues, and when he is on, he's a top-tier talent. He was in the MVP conversation late last season."
